# Optional overrides. No .env.local is needed for the usual setups.
# When WP-CLI reads siteurl, hot mode uses the existing HTTPS proxy:
# internal 18000-18020, public port = internal port - 10000.
# Otherwise, hot mode uses Vite's local HTTP server and automatic port selection.
#
# Example for direct local HTTP without the HTTPS proxy:
# WP_SITE_URL=http://your-site.test
# VITE_DEV_SERVER_URL=http://localhost:5173
# VITE_PORT=5173
